--- !u!114 &37
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_PrefabParentObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInternal: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 20}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 5c72f74e0767fb356f3061a3249ebe49, type: 3}
  m_Name:
  m_AimStabilizationUpgrades:
    m_Name: AIM STABILIZATION
    m_Location: 2
    m_Passive: 1
    m_UpgradeData:
    - m_Parents:
      m_Name: MOTION CONTROL 1
      m_ShortDescription: 'Use: Reduces weapon kickback by 50%.'
      m_Description: "Use: Reduces weapon kickback by 50%.\n\nActivation: Automatic.\n\nEnergy consumption: None.\n\n\nThe Aim Stabilizer’s base functionalities enable users to retain up to 50% of their targeting accuracy while in motion."
      m_Cost: 1
      m_Purchased: 0
      m_KickScaler: 0.5
    - m_Parents: 00000000
      m_Name: MOTION CONTROL 2
      m_ShortDescription: 'Use: Negates nearly all weapon kickback.'
      m_Description: "Use: Negates nearly all weapon kickback.\n\nActivation: Automatic.\n\nEnergy consumption: None.\n\n\nIncreased familiarity with signals coming from the Aim Stabilizer’s implanted elements enables users to maintain up to 100% of their targeting accuracy while in motion."
      m_Cost: 2
      m_Purchased: 0
      m_KickScaler: 0.1
  m_MoveSilentlyUpgrades:
    m_Name: MOVEMENT
    m_Location: 6
    m_Passive: 1
    m_UpgradeData:
    - m_Parents:
      m_Name: RUN SILENTLY
      m_ShortDescription: 'Use: Run and walk silently.'
      m_Description: "Use: Run and walk silently.\n\nActivation: Automatic.\n\nEnergy Consumption: None.\n\n\nCybernetic Leg users can become virtually silent while running once they learn to leverage tiny motors and shock-absorbing liquid polymer buffers found inside the prosthesis."
      m_Cost: 1
      m_Purchased: 0
      m_MoveSilentlyNoiseRadius: 1
  m_HackingCaptureUpgrades:
    m_Name: HACKING CAPTURE
    m_Location: 0
    m_Passive: 1
    m_UpgradeData:
    - m_Parents:
      m_Name: CAPTURE 1
      m_ShortDescription: 'Use: Able to Hack Level 1 Terminals.'
      m_Description: "Use: Able to Hack 1 Terminals\r.\n\r\nActivation: Automatic.\r\n\r\nEnergy consumption: None.\r\n\r\n\r\nAt it’s most basic level, the MHD-995 Hacking Device provides its user with the enhanced ability to override Level 1 terminals and security camera systems."
      m_Cost: 0
      m_Purchased: 1
      m_CaptureProgramRating: 1
      m_CameraDominationActive: 0
      m_DoorDominationActive: 1
      m_RobotDominationActive: 0
      m_TurretDominationActive: 0
    - m_Parents: 00000000
      m_Name: CAPTURE 2
      m_ShortDescription: 'Use: Able to Hack Level 2 Terminals.'
      m_Description: "Use: Able to Hack Level 2 Terminals.\n\r\nActivation: Automatic.\r\n\r\nEnergy consumption: None.\r\n\r\n\r\nWith some familiarity, the MHD-995 Hacking Device can discover increased competence in hacking node capture speed."
      m_Cost: 1
      m_Purchased: 0
      m_CaptureProgramRating: 2
      m_CameraDominationActive: 0
      m_DoorDominationActive: 1
      m_RobotDominationActive: 0
      m_TurretDominationActive: 0
    - m_Parents: 01000000
      m_Name: CAPTURE 3
      m_ShortDescription: 'Use: Able to Hack Level 3 Terminals.'
      m_Description: "Use: Able to Hack Level 3 Terminals\r.\n\r\nActivation: Automatic.\r\n\r\nEnergy consumption: None.\r\n\r\n\r\nExperienced users of the MHD-995 Hacking Device gain an authoritative edge over interlaced system nodes, enabling them to  increase the speed at which they capture hacking nodes even more."
      m_Cost: 1
      m_Purchased: 0
      m_CaptureProgramRating: 3
      m_CameraDominationActive: 0
      m_DoorDominationActive: 1
      m_RobotDominationActive: 0
      m_TurretDominationActive: 0
    - m_Parents: 02000000
      m_Name: CAPTURE 4
      m_ShortDescription: 'Use: Able to Hack Level 4 Terminals.'
      m_Description: "Use: Able to Hack Level 4 Terminals\r.\n\r\nActivation: Automatic.\r\n\r\nEnergy consumption: None.\r\n\r\n\r\nExperienced users of the MHD-995 Hacking Device gain an authoritative edge over interlaced system nodes, enabling them to  increase the speed at which they capture hacking nodes even more."
      m_Cost: 1
      m_Purchased: 0
      m_CaptureProgramRating: 4
      m_CameraDominationActive: 0
      m_DoorDominationActive: 1
      m_RobotDominationActive: 0
      m_TurretDominationActive: 0
    - m_Parents: 03000000
      m_Name: CAPTURE 5
      m_ShortDescription: 'Use: Able to Hack Level 5 Terminals.'
      m_Description: "Use: Able to Hack Level 5 Terminals.\n\r\nActivation: Automatic.\r\n\r\nEnergy consumption: None.\r\n\r\n\r\nMastering the MHD-995 Hacking Device gifts users with a mastery over all foreign electronic systems, thus enabling them to navigate and control pathways and nodes with the ease of a network administrator."
      m_Cost: 1
      m_Purchased: 0
      m_CaptureProgramRating: 5
      m_CameraDominationActive: 0
      m_DoorDominationActive: 1
      m_RobotDominationActive: 0
      m_TurretDominationActive: 0
    - m_Parents:
      m_Name: CAMERA DOMINATION
      m_ShortDescription: 'Use: Deactivate Cameras linked to Security hubs.'
      m_Description: "Use: Deactivate Cameras linked to Security hubs.\r\n\r\nActivation: Automatic.\r\n\r\nEnergy Consumption: None.\r\n\r\n\r\nThe MHD -995 Hacking Device has a powerful suite of enhanced functionalities that, in addition to the penetration of firewalls for clandestine data retrieval, can also enable an experienced hacker to co-opt and take control of deeper subsystems, such as those used by security cameras."
      m_Cost: 1
      m_Purchased: 0
      m_CaptureProgramRating: 0
      m_CameraDominationActive: 1
      m_DoorDominationActive: 1
      m_RobotDominationActive: 0
      m_TurretDominationActive: 0
    - m_Parents: 05000000
      m_Name: ROBOT DOMINATION
      m_ShortDescription: 'Use: Disable Robots and Turrets  or turn them against their allies.'
      m_Description: "Use: Disable Robots and Turrets linked to security hubs or turn them against their allies.\r\n\r\nActivation: Automatic.\r\n\r\nEnergy consumption: None.\r\n\r\n\r\nUsers who decide to hone their co-option skills even further will eventually be able to seize control of robots and either turn them against friendly forces or shut them down entirely."
      m_Cost: 2
      m_Purchased: 0
      m_CaptureProgramRating: 0
      m_CameraDominationActive: 0
      m_DoorDominationActive: 1
      m_RobotDominationActive: 1
      m_TurretDominationActive: 1
  m_SocialEnhancerUpgrades:
    m_Name: SOCIAL ENHANCER
    m_Location: 0
    m_Passive: 1
    m_UpgradeData:
    - m_Parents:
      m_Name: EMOTIONAL ENHANCER
      m_ShortDescription: 'Use: Analyze people and persuade them into following certain courses of action.'
      m_Description: "Use: Analyze people and persuade them into following certain courses of action.\n\nActivation: Contextual.\n\nEnergy consumption: None.\n\n\nThe Emotional Intelligence Enhancer combines several systems, including an Optical Polygraph, Personality Analyzer, and Synthetic Pheromones Propagator."
      m_Cost: 2
      m_Purchased: 0
      m_SocialEnhancerActive: 1
  m_EnergyUpgrades:
    m_Name: ENERGY CONVERTER
    m_Location: 1
    m_Passive: 1
    m_UpgradeData:
    - m_Parents:
      m_Name: ENERGY LEVEL UPGRADE 1
      m_ShortDescription: 'Use: Grants an extra energy cell.'
      m_Description: "Use: Grants an extra energy cell.\r\n\r\nActivation: Automatic.\r\n\r\nEnergy consumption: None.\r\n\r\n\r\nIntermediate users of the Energy Converter can fill up an additional energy cell for later use, giving them a total count of 3."
      m_Cost: 1
      m_Purchased: 0
      m_EnergyContainerAmount: 3
      m_RechargeCapacity: 0
      m_EnergyRechargeRate: 0
    - m_Parents: 00000000
      m_Name: ENERGY LEVEL UPGRADE 2
      m_ShortDescription: 'Use: Grants an extra energy cell.'
      m_Description: "Use: Grants an extra energy cell.\r\n\r\nActivation: Automatic.\r\n\r\nEnergy consumption: None.\r\n\r\n\r\nAdvances Energy Converter users can create yet one more energy cell for later use, giving them a total count of 4."
      m_Cost: 2
      m_Purchased: 0
      m_EnergyContainerAmount: 4
      m_RechargeCapacity: 0
      m_EnergyRechargeRate: 0
    - m_Parents: 01000000
      m_Name: ENERGY LEVEL UPGRADE 3
      m_ShortDescription: 'Use: Grants an extra energy cell.'
      m_Description: "Use: Grants an extra energy cell.\r\n\r\nActivation: Automatic.\r\n\r\nEnergy consumption: None.\r\n\r\n\r\nMastery of the Energy Converter enables users to rely on a total count of 5 energy cells for later use."
      m_Cost: 3
      m_Purchased: 0
      m_EnergyContainerAmount: 5
      m_RechargeCapacity: 0
      m_EnergyRechargeRate: 0
    - m_Parents: 00000000
      m_Name: ENERGY RECHARGE RATE 1
      m_ShortDescription: 'Use: Speeds up energy recharge.'
      m_Description: "Use: Speeds up energy recharge.\r\n\r\nActivation: Automatic.\r\n\r\nEnergy consumption: none.\r\n\r\n\r\nAdvanced Energy Converter users can feel their Energy Reclamation System start to kick in after only 5 seconds. Once active, the system will recharge a single energy cell in approximately 25 more seconds."
      m_Cost: 1
      m_Purchased: 0
      m_EnergyContainerAmount: 0
      m_RechargeCapacity: 0
      m_EnergyRechargeRate: 0.25
    - m_Parents: 03000000
      m_Name: ENERGY RECHARGE RATE 2
      m_ShortDescription: 'Use: Speeds up energy recharge.'
      m_Description: "Use: Speeds up energy recharge.\r\n\r\nActivation: Automatic.\r\n\r\nEnergy consumption: none.\r\n\r\n\r\nThe most experienced Energy Converter users will only need 20 seconds for one cell to recharge fully, with no delay before charge-up begins."
      m_Cost: 2
      m_Purchased: 0
      m_EnergyContainerAmount: 0
      m_RechargeCapacity: 0
      m_EnergyRechargeRate: 0.45
    - m_Parents: 02000000
      m_Name: ENERGY CAPACITY UPGRADE
      m_ShortDescription: 'Use: Increases amount of auto-fll energy cells by 1.'
      m_Description: 'Use: Increases amount of auto-fll energy cell by 1.'
      m_Cost: 1
      m_Purchased: 0
      m_EnergyContainerAmount: 0
      m_RechargeCapacity: 2
      m_EnergyRechargeRate: 0
  m_StengthUpgrades:
    m_Name: STRENGTH
    m_Location: 2
    m_Passive: 1
    m_UpgradeData:
    - m_Parents:
      m_Name: MOVE HEAVY OBJECTS
      m_ShortDescription: 'Use: Move heavier objects out of your way.'
      m_Description: "Use: Move heavier objects out of your way.\n\nActivation: Contextual.\n\nEnergy consumption: Low.\n\n\nWith practice, people equipped with the Cybernetic Arm Prosthesis will be able to optimize the limb’s myomer muscle modules to greatly increase brute strength when moving heavy objects."
      m_Cost: 1
      m_Purchased: 0
      m_CanMoveHeavyObject: 1
      m_CanBreakThroughWall: 0
    - m_Parents: 00000000
      m_Name: PUNCH THROUGH WALL
      m_ShortDescription: 'Use: Blast through weakened walls.'
      m_Description: "Use: Blast through weakened walls.\r\n\r\nActivation: Conextual.\r\n\r\nEnergy consumption: 1 energy cell.\r\n\r\n\r\nMastering use of the Cybernetic Arm's shock buffers and strengthened bone frames allows people equipped with the prosthesis to break through light walls with a powerful punch."
      m_Cost: 2
      m_Purchased: 0
      m_CanMoveHeavyObject: 1
      m_CanBreakThroughWall: 1
  m_InfoLinkUpgrades:
    m_Name: INFOLINK
    m_Location: 0
    m_Passive: 1
    m_UpgradeData:
    - m_Parents:
      m_Name: INFOLINK
      m_ShortDescription: 'Use: Communicate wirelessly anywhere.'
      m_Description: "Use: Communicate wirelessly anywhere.\r\n\r\n\r\nThe Infolink telecommunications Package enables users to receive and transmit messages without generating audible sounds through implanted cochlear and vibration devices."
      m_Cost: 0
      m_Purchased: 1
  m_CloakingUpgrades:
    m_Name: CLOAKING
    m_Location: 5
    m_Passive: 0
    m_UpgradeData:
    - m_Parents:
      m_Name: CLOAKING LEVEL 1
      m_ShortDescription: 'Use: Becomes invisible for a short period of time.'
      m_Description: "Use: Becomes invisible for a short period of time. Warning: people can still hear you move!\r\n\r\nActivation: Manual.\r\n\r\nEnergy consumption: High.\r\n\r\n\r\nWhen activated, the GlassShield Cloaking System augmentation bends the light hitting the user, rendering him practically invisible. The effect will work on any wavelength that is part of the visual spectrum, including laser beams."
      m_Cost: 1
      m_Purchased: 0
      m_DurationPerEnergyCell: 3
    - m_Parents: 00000000
      m_Name: CLOAKING LEVEL 2
      m_ShortDescription: 'Use: Regulates the rate at which energy is consumed while cloaking.'
      m_Description: "Use: Regulates the rate at which energy is consumed while cloaking.\r\n\r\nActivation time: 3 seconds per energy cell.\r\n\r\n\r\nWhen activated, the GlassShield Cloaking System augmentation bends the light hitting the user, rendering him practically invisible. The effect will work on any wavelength that is part of the visual spectrum, including laser beams.\r\n"
      m_Cost: 2
      m_Purchased: 0
      m_DurationPerEnergyCell: 5
    - m_Parents: 01000000
      m_Name: CLOAKING LEVEL 3
      m_ShortDescription: 'Use: Regulates the rate at which energy is consumed while cloaking.'
      m_Description: "Activation time: 5 seconds per energy cell.\r\n\r\n\r\nWhen activated, the GlassShield Cloaking System augmentation bends the light hitting the user, rendering him practically invisible. The effect will work on any wavelength that is part of the visual spectrum, including laser beams."
      m_Cost: 3
      m_Purchased: 0
      m_DurationPerEnergyCell: 7
  m_IcarusLandingUpgrades:
    m_Name: ICARUS LANDING SYSTEM
    m_Location: 1
    m_Passive: 1
    m_UpgradeData:
    - m_Parents:
      m_Name: ICARUS LANDING SYSTEM
      m_ShortDescription: 'Use: Fall from any height without fear of injury.'
      m_Description: "Use: Fall from any height without fear of injury.\r\n\r\n\r\nThe Icarus Landing System is a discreet augmentation surgically implanted in the user's lower back, slightly above the coccyx at the base of the vertebral column."
      m_Cost: 0
      m_Purchased: 1
  m_ArmorUpgrades:
    m_Name: ARMOR
    m_Location: 5
    m_Passive: 0
    m_UpgradeData:
    - m_Parents:
      m_Name: ARMOR LEVEL 1
      m_ShortDescription: 'Use: Reduce incoming damage by 20%.'
      m_Description: "Use: Reduce damage at the cost of 2 energy cells. When the Armor meter is depleted, damage reduction will no longer occur until activate again.\r\n\r\nActivation: Use from Quick Slot.\r\n\r\nSub-dermal Electrostatic Armor Plating is a modified version of Rhino Dermal Armor takes advantage power cell energy to electrically charge near-weightless microfiber armor plating implanted beneath the subject's skin. This type of armor allows more flexibility and greater protection to the user at the cost of increased energy usage."
      m_Cost: 1
      m_Purchased: 0
      m_DamageReductionPercentAmount: 20
    - m_Parents: 00000000
      m_Name: ARMOR LEVEL 2
      m_ShortDescription: 'Use: Reduce incoming damage by 40%.'
      m_Description: "Use: Reduce damage at the cost of 2 energy cells. When the Armor meter is depleted, damage reduction will no longer occur until activate again.\r\n\r\nActivation: Use from Quick Slot.\r\n\r\nSub-dermal Electrostatic Armor Plating is a modified version of Rhino Dermal Armor takes advantage power cell energy to electrically charge near-weightless microfiber armor plating implanted beneath the subject's skin. This type of armor allows more flexibility and greater protection to the user at the cost of increased energy usage."
      m_Cost: 2
      m_Purchased: 0
      m_DamageReductionPercentAmount: 40
    - m_Parents: 01000000
      m_Name: ARMOR LEVEL 3
      m_ShortDescription: 'Use: Reduce incoming damage by 60%.'
      m_Description: "Use: Reduce damage at the cost of 2 energy cells. When the Armor meter is depleted, damage reduction will no longer occur until activate again.\r\n\r\nActivation: Use from Quick Slot.\r\n\r\nSub-dermal Electrostatic Armor Plating is a modified version of Rhino Dermal Armor takes advantage power cell energy to electrically charge near-weightless microfiber armor plating implanted beneath the subject's skin. This type of armor allows more flexibility and greater protection to the user at the cost of increased energy usage."
